Finally, if $G_B$ is a \textit{Snowdrift Game}, full cooperation is reached irrespectively of the initial $\rho_0$, and the game played will be the HG. Due to feedback, the SD loses stability of its nontrivial equilibrium, which becomes unstable and unphysical ($\rho^*<0$).
