  The reduction $R(\phi,\mathcal{T})$ can be computed in linear time or logarithmic space for a given tree decomposition. %In
  %particular, 
  We have $|\psi_1| + |\psi_2|\in O\big(|\phi|+|\mathcal{T}|\big)$.
  %
