\end{proposition}
\begin{proof}
Let~$\mathcal{T}=(T,\chi,\delta)$ be the given labeled TD.
Without loss of generality, we may assume that the size of~$\mathcal{T}$ is linear in $|\phi|$~\cite{BodlaenderKloks96}.
