Then, Equation~(\ref{lab:wcnf}), (\ref{lab:wcnf3}) is computed for every clause~$c\in\clauses(\phi)$
and Equations~(\ref{eq:o1})--(\ref{eq2:e2}) are computed for every node in~$T$ and in the context of a single clause.
