\begin{definition}[Rogue Model For Cubic and Bipartite]\label{def:rogue_3}
 Let $t$ be a node in~$T$.
 A model~$M$ of a formula~$\phi'\supseteq R^{\text{C+B}}(\phi, \mathcal{T})$
