\begin{abstract}
  We calculate the rational representation-ring-graded stable stems
  for rank 1 groups, $SU(2), SO(3), Pin (2), O(2), Spin(2)$ and
  $SO(2)$, in the same spirit as the calculations for finite groups in
  \cite{GSerrefinite}. 
\end{abstract}

