Although somewhat special with respect to the complexity of the real world of scientific inquiry, the statistical setting (\ref{eq:usual-setting}) is deemed adequate to interpret the current logic foundations of weak AI. Here, this paper considers the creativity aspect of strong AI. While it has been playing a fundamental role in scientific inquiry from ancient times, creativity has appeared to be such an elusive concept that it is hitherto difficult to have a well-accepted definition. %A common sense understanding of creativity seemed to have been summarized well in
