\begin{remark}\rm
    Note that models F81, F84 and TN93 are multiplicatively closed for fixed $\pi$; a desirable property for phylogenetic inference, see \cite{Sumner_gtr}. Other commonly used submodels of TN93, such as HKY85 \cite{HKY85}, are not multiplicatively closed. 
