$\bar{p}=(\Lambda^{e_1},\dots,\Lambda^{e_n})\cdot \bar{q}$, that is, 
\begin{equation}\label{eq:eigenvalues_p_q}
\bar{p}_{i_1\dots i_n}=\lambda^{e_1}_{i_1}\dots\lambda^{e_n}_{i_n}\bar{q}_{i_1\dots i_n}.
\end{equation}

