In this case, for arbitrary choice of such matrices,  \[F(yx) = \M{a & b \\ c&d \\ g & h}\M{\alpha \\ \beta} = \M{a\alpha + b\beta \\ c\alpha + d\beta \\ g\alpha +h\beta}.\]

Now that the idea of a functor has been presented, we will also define maps between functors.
