Reactions & Propensities \\ \hline \hline
\ce{D + P -> D\text{:}P} & $\frac{k_f}{\Omega} n_D\cdot n_P$  \\ \hline
\ce{D\text{:}P -> D + P} & $k_b n_{D\text{:}P}$  \\ \hline
\ce{D -> D + M} & $\alpha_m n_D$  \\ \hline
