Applying the formula (\ref{OmegaG}) to the pair $(\Gcal_0, J)$ we get the symplectic form $ \Omega(\Gamma_0)$ which can be written as follows:

\begin{equation}\label{OmegaSt}
    \Omega(\Gamma_0)= \frac{1}{2} \sum_{j=1}^{2g-1} \mathrm{Tr}\left(K_{[1...j]}^{-1} dK_{[1...j]} \wedge K_j^{-1} dK_j \right)
